      "side": 1,
      "message": "My one concern with removing Bp_text is that there is not a guaranteed 1:1 mapping between Bp_text and TargetName(). If we are converting with bp2build, there will be, but if we use a handcrafted target via bazel_module.label, that isn\u0027t guaranteed. For example one of the cases I converted recently, the names do not match because we only need 1 Bazel target for multiple Soong targets: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:prebuilts/clang/host/linux-x86/Android.bp;l\u003d96-107;drc\u003d17820b0a70527ef1cd46fe7fb12451b3816a0246.",
